{"id":"n67498-1-10","stage":4,"title":"연료 · 燃料","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67498-1-10-1","ko":"곧 주유소에 들러야 할 것 같아. 연료가 떨어져 가.","zh":"我好像得马上去加油站了，油快用完了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주유소에","meaning":"加油站","explanation":"주유소：加油站；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"주유소","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76992","senseId":"1","lemma":"주유소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들러야","meaning":"顺便去一下","explanation":"들르다：顺便去一下；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"들르다","audio":"/audio/3f6dc717f37be815b110.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67876","senseId":"1","lemma":"들르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"연료가","meaning":"燃料","explanation":"연료：燃料；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"연료","audio":"/audio/04a0e8a1de0706ea59ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67498","senseId":"1","lemma":"연료","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨어져","meaning":"不足，短缺，耗尽","explanation":"떨어지다：不足，短缺，耗尽；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"떨어지다","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89796","senseId":"19","lemma":"떨어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가.","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"17","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"dd9e5842a0fb47ea","term":"주유소","zh":"加油站","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3","entryId":"76992","definition":"往汽车等里添加燃料油的地方。","pronunciation":["주ː유소"]},{"id":"3f6dc717f37be815","term":"들르다","zh":"顺便去一下","audio":"/audio/3f6dc717f37be815b110.mp3","entryId":"67876","definition":"路过时进去逗留一会儿。","pronunciation":["들르다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]},{"id":"04a0e8a1de0706ea","term":"연료","zh":"燃料","audio":"/audio/04a0e8a1de0706ea59ea.mp3","entryId":"67498","definition":"通过燃烧来发光、发热或获得发动机器的能量的物质。","pronunciation":["열료"]},{"id":"5360fef914150d39","term":"떨어지다","zh":"不足，短缺，耗尽","audio":"/audio/5360fef914150d393574.mp3","entryId":"89796","definition":"没进行补充，所以现在没有剩余。","pronunciation":["떠러지다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"消失不见。","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/573b62cc19653381f67b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n67498-1-10-2","ko":"알겠어. 지도에서 주유소를 찾아볼게.","zh":"知道了，我会在地图上找找加油站的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"알겠어.","meaning":"懂，明白","explanation":"알다：懂，明白；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"9","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지도에서","meaning":"地图","explanation":"지도：地图；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"지도","audio":"/audio/82c5fe62d75b8c38b810.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57319","senseId":"1","lemma":"지도","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주유소를","meaning":"加油站","explanation":"주유소：加油站；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"주유소","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76992","senseId":"1","lemma":"주유소","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"찾아볼게.","meaning":"查找，搜索；试，试图","explanation":"찾다：查找，搜索；보다：试，试图；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"찾다","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3"},{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57320","senseId":"3","lemma":"찾다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"懂，明白","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于对方的某个命令或请求，同意听从。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]},{"id":"82c5fe62d75b8c38","term":"지도","zh":"地图","audio":"/audio/82c5fe62d75b8c38b810.mp3","entryId":"57319","definition":"按一定比例缩小整个地球表面或部分地域，运用规定符号而画在平面上的图。","pronunciation":["지도"]},{"id":"dd9e5842a0fb47ea","term":"주유소","zh":"加油站","audio":"/audio/dd9e5842a0fb47ea92a5.mp3","entryId":"76992","definition":"往汽车等里添加燃料油的地方。","pronunciation":["주ː유소"]},{"id":"0aa19509314fd879","term":"찾다","zh":"查找，搜索","audio":"/audio/0aa19509314fd87953eb.mp3","entryId":"57320","definition":"为了弄清不懂的东西而查看书或查电脑。","pronunciation":["찯따"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试，试图","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"表示试着做前面所指的行为。","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/95746fc0da299eb377a8.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.117,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=67498","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":148,"sequenceScore":2.9437,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["知道了，我会在地图上找找加油站的。","没能照顾好母亲，全都是我的错。","我好像得马上去加油站了，油快用完了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["知道了，我会在地图上找找加油站的。","我好像得马上去加油站了，油快用完了。","没能照顾好母亲，全都是我的错。"],"answer":0}]}
